Two days after Washington revoked his visa, Bolivia arrested its attorney general. This is Omni View Central &amp; South America, Episode 9. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. CBS News reports that an unnamed Ministry of Government source told AFP police took Attorney General Roger Moriaka into custody on Wednesday. Local media said officers also arrested Santa Cruz prosecutor Alberto Zabalos, already sanctioned by Washington.

