00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:38.780
whom the United States State Department accused this week of corruption, drug trafficking links,

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:43.660
or plotting against their governments. Police searched prosecutor's offices in Sucre.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.160
